  "qualification": [
    "Pure scalar/reducer fixtures construct actual trainer parties; they are not natural complete battles or injected victory fixtures.",
    "No battle.ts/battle-math.ts/main/UI/World changes or newly admitted effects.",
    "No Transform/BatonPass/doubles controller is implemented. Current-type/ability/held-item conditions must be supplied by a native host, not inferred from species alone.",
